welcome to the blessed one let the let the blessed one be seated this seat is ready and so the blessed one sat down on the seat made ready and the wonder of achagata took a low seat sat at one side and said this to the blessed one venerable sir i've heard this the recluse gotama claims to be omniscient and all seeing to have complete knowledge and vision thus

