you will be saying what has been said by me will not misrepresent me with the contrary fact you will explain in accordance with the dharma in such a way that nothing which provides a ground for censure can be legitimately deduced from your assertion but insofar as i wish this this is the first knowledge so insofar as i wish i recollect my manifold past lives

